{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018gX2inNV3W83bE9qRJKTH1","type":"tool_result","content":"     0→# Current Evaluation State\n     1→\n     2→## Active Text\n     3→- **Name:** masque_of_red_death\n     4→- **Attempt:** 20\n     5→- **Phase:** awaiting_fix\n     6→- **baseline_score:** 6.75\n     7→\n     8→## Output Files\n     9→- HTML: output/masque_of_red_death/report.html\n    10→- JSON: output/masque_of_red_death/analysis.json\n    11→\n    12→## Latest Scores\n    13→- Structure Detection: 10/10\n    14→- Character Extraction: 7/10\n    15→- Character Profiles: 6/10 ← IMPROVED from 5/10 (attempt 19)\n    16→- Chapter Summaries: 9/10\n    17→- Pronunciation Guide: 6/10\n    18→- HTML Presentation: 8/10\n    19→- **Overall: 7.85/10** (threshold: 8.0)\n    20→\n    21→## Score Delta from Baseline (Attempt 1)\n    22→- Structure: 10 -> 10 (unchanged)\n    23→- Characters: 5 -> 7 (+2 improvement from baseline)\n    24→- Profiles: 2 -> 6 (+4 improvement from baseline)\n    25→- Summaries: 9 -> 9 (unchanged)\n    26→- Pronunciation: 5 -> 6 (+1 improvement)\n    27→- Presentation: 9 -> 8 (-1 regression)\n    28→- **Overall: 6.75 -> 7.85 (+1.10 improvement)**\n    29→\n    30→## Gap to Threshold\n    31→Current: 7.85 | Threshold: 8.0 | Gap: **0.15 points**\n    32→\n    33→## Attempt 20 Result: PARTIAL SUCCESS ✓\n    34→\n    35→### What Was Tried\n    36→Adaptive MIN_MENTIONS_FOR_PROFILE threshold for short texts (threshold of 2 for texts < 5000 words).\n    37→\n    38→### Result\n    39→**PARTIAL SUCCESS** - Profile generation stage now runs:\n    40→- Duration: 26.65s (was 0.0s)\n    41→- LLM calls: 3 (was 0)\n    42→- Items processed: 2 (was 0)\n    43→- Confidence: 2 high (was 0)\n    44→\n    45→**BUT**: The generated profiles are stored in the `descriptions` array, NOT in the structured `appearance`, `personality`, `voice_guidance` fields which remain null.\n    46→\n    47→### Score Impact\n    48→- Character Profiles: 