ords\n    81→\n    82→### LOW\n    83→5. **Mention count doesn't include aliases**\n    84→   - Problem: \"the Prince Prospero\" shows 3 mentions, but \"Prospero\" appears 18 times\n    85→   - The combined count should be ~21\n    86→   - Location: Mention counting logic\n    87→\n    88→## Recommended Next Fix (Attempt 21)\n    89→\n    90→### Priority: Populate Structured Profile Fields (quickest path to 8.0)\n    91→\n    92→The profile generation is now running and producing good content in `descriptions`. The issue is that `appearance`, `personality`, and `voice_guidance` remain null.\n    93→\n    94→**Investigation needed:**\n    95→1. Check how `_generate_character_profile()` handles the LLM response\n    96→2. The LLM may be returning unstructured text that goes to `descriptions`\n    97→3. Need to either:\n    98→   a. Modify LLM prompt to return structured JSON with appearance/personality/voice_guidance\n    99→   b. Post-process the descriptions text to extract structured fields\n   100→   c. Modify the code that populates Character model to also set structured fields\n   101→\n   102→**Expected Impact:** +0.15+ points on Profiles (6→7), reaching 8.0 threshold\n   103→\n   104→## What NOT to Try Again\n   105→- Pre-merge substring matching (attempts 17-18) - FAILED\n   106→- Prompt-based rules (attempts 3, 14) - ineffective alone\n   107→- Context window adjustments (attempts 7-15) - insufficient\n   108→\n   109→## Fix History\n   110→\n   111→### Attempts 1-18\n   112→See git history and previous EVALUATION_STATE.md entries.\n   113→\n   114→### Attempt 19 - SUCCESS ✓\n   115→- **Change:** POST-PROCESSING cross-character alias fix\n   116→- **Files Modified:** `src/agents/characters.py` (added `_fix_misplaced_aliases()` method)\n   117→- **Result:** SUCCESS - Prospero alias correctly moved to Prince Prospero\n   118→- **Score Impact:** +1.0 overall (6.70 → 7.70)\n   119→- **Status:** Fix is working\n   120→\n   121→### Attempt 20 - PARTIAL SUCCESS\n  